 + x - 1}$.\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.\n\n- **I.** $x=-1$\n- **II.** $x=0$\n- **III.** $x=1$" :question/worked-solution "After cancellation, $f(x)=\\frac{x + 1}{x^{2} + 1}$. Its real denominator zeros are $\\emptyset$; canceled factors produce holes, not vertical asymptotes."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186088275 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087713 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ed7286fe-b6e2-5544-8bc6-86afc6cdb813" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Matrix by Its Description"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ee46ad41-124c-53b8-b6fe-63c0a88d4fe8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439889} {:answer/id #uuid "8629d8d0-9ca6-56ce-867f-945ea13c3797" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439890}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ee46ad41-124c-53b8-b6fe-63c0a88d4fe8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439889} :answer-field/id #uuid "e29f9d5a-51a1-5308-aa39-b231d03d0e68" :answer-field/key "B" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440302} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bc3a0779-7d5b-56e4-82af-75fda030c3a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439891} {:answer/id #uuid "150058cf-6ee0-5f8d-985b-8f5aadf247e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439892}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bc3a0779-7d5b-56e4-82af-75fda030c3a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439891} :answer-field/id #uui